 class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/97f4fa44c3038ab22cf1b0983a652e34.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Unique Skill\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card has its own unique skill, unlocked gradually as you progress through the stages, with usage charges earned through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/470aa67a3b4aaf60da4ee0a314258bfd.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Custom Deck\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the later part of the journey, players unlock deck customization. Expanding and refining the deck improves the probability of forming preferred combinations, allowing more strategic victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/extras/7702cab63af51a5b911819794fd6a8e7.avif?t=1763169535\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CHENGDU KEBADOU EDUCATION TECHNOLOGY CO.,LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956550/23d5d084dec8bd6af5d0139b4315b0a15e681ad4/header.jpg?t=1763169535","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s